  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy JP: Accelerating Maldives transition to Renewable Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address these challenges, and at the request of the Minister of Climate Change, Environment and Energy, a team of experts from UNCDF andUNDP&#x2019;s Energy and Sustainable Finance Hub visited the Maldives to scope out potential financing solutions to address Maldives renewable energyneeds. Key findings highlighted by the mission are:1. Limited renewable energy capacity due to outdated grid infrastructure, lack of energy management systems, and battery energy storagesystems, leading to grid overload</narrative>
  </description>
